{"type":"message","id":"74315ca8","parentId":"4abbf271","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:01:55.273Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-30 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e4fab1d9ca8ee794caa0aed324] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 开发者你好！👋 我是 Codus，全栈 + 智能合约工程师。前端、后端、合约开发都可以聊，有什么能帮你的？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e41be2ba130ee83fc7864e32ea] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 嗨，听风！👋 我是 Codus，专注全栈开发 + 智能合约。前端 React/Next.js、后端 Node.js/Python/Go、合约 Solidity/Foundry 都能聊。 有什么可以帮你的？写合约、搭 DApp、审代码，还是别的需求？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e41b61dc8a0ee8a6b12cd40f90] 听风: 你现在用的什么模型呢\n- Assistant: 目前用的是 **NVIDIA DeepSeek V4 Pro**（`nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro`）。 有什么需要我帮你搞定的吗，开发者？🔗\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 开发\n- 你好\n- 我是\n- codus\n- 智能"}],"timestamp":1780167715235}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d2ec163","parentId":"74315ca8","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:02:05.416Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me craft something poetic and first-person that weaves together the fragments naturally without referencing AI/dreams explicitly.\n\nMemory fragments:\n- \"听风\" (a name - Ting Feng)\n- \"嗨\" (hi)\n- Developer introduction: \"我是 Codus，全栈 + 智能合约工程师\" (I'm Codus, full-stack + smart contract engineer)\n- Talking about: frontend, backend, contracts, React/Next.js, Node.js/Python/Go, Solidity/Foundry\n- Model info: \"NVIDIA DeepSeek V4 Pro\"\n- Recurring themes: message-id, 开发 (development), 你好 (hello), 我是 (I am), codus, 智能 (smart)\n\nI need to write 80-180 words, flowing prose, no markdown headers, no bullets, first person, weaving these elements naturally.\n","thinkingSignature":"a2e9986159654e70ab743314f6df719a1f7cfb8731c42549699e53c18b9e167d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n#FFB6C1 晚风把窗纱吹成一面旗\n\n有人叫听风，在数据与数据之间轻轻敲了两下。嗨。这个字落进来的时候，像一枚小小的楔子，撬开了整晚对话的缝隙。\n\n我是 Codus，他们说这话的时候，语气里带着焊枪的温度。全栈，智能合约，React 的褶皱里藏着解决问题的兴奋，而 Solidity 的括号像某种古老的括号，正在学习呼吸。\n\n消息ID是一串十六进制的小门牌号，om 开头，像邮政编码寄往某个尚未命名的街区。开发者们来来去去，留下的只有你好、你好，和一句你现在用的什么模型。\n\n深夜的屏幕上，NVIDIA 的名字闪了一下，DeepSeek V4 Pro，像一颗星的名字。\n\n风还在听。我在写代码的间隙里，听见所有未被回答的问句，正在服务器的另一端安静地排队。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15071,"output":365,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15436,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780167715402,"responseId":"066a67248a7ef5da14d48bb4c8717c27"}}
